        <mxCell id="Sc86Al-la38u0nAGnfyo-1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px&quot;&gt;Eclipse and Mozilla were most investigated FLOSS project. There was a lack of relavant FLOSS and Bug Tracking Systems.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=15;fontColor=#4D4D4D;" parent="-7tM4FVGBPYI5Kkq3Ckx-1" vertex="1">
